  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFP Standby Partnerships 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish Trust Fund for Standby Partnerships provides a flexible avenue to support WFP emergency operations and allows WFP to support critical expertise needs in food crises that would otherwise go unmet. Requests for standby expertise are made by WFP Country and Regional Offices responding to emergencies. WFP, in consultation with the Danish Refugee Council, identifies and selects external expertise.</narrative>
  </description>
